              <div class="hint" id="pwHintText">키 유도: PBKDF2-SHA256 · 200,000 iterations · salt 16B<br>암호화: AES-256-GCM (파일별 개별 nonce, MANI/FTBL/FDAT/AIIN 각각 암호화)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="field" id="kdfFieldWrap" style="display:none;">
