      <span class="sc-label">.jno 저장</span><span class="sc-key">Ctrl / ⌘ S</span>
      <span class="sc-label">파일/폴더 검색</span><span class="sc-key">Ctrl / ⌘ F</span>
      <span class="sc-label">미리보기 파일 삭제</span><span class="sc-key">Delete</span>
      <span class="sc-label">모달 · 메뉴 닫기</span><span class="sc-key">Esc</span>
